# File Size And Decomposition

- Prefer keeping modules under ~200 lines when avoidable.
- Split ISA ops into `pytierra/services/isa/ops_*.py` rather than one giant instruct module.
- Allowed exceptions: generated files; state briefly when exceeding the guideline.
- Genebank / observer aggregators (`rambank.py`, `diskbank.py`, `services/vm/service.py`) may exceed
  ~200 lines when keeping C-algorithm cohesion; prefer extracting helpers
  (`hashutil`, `labels`, `write_queue`, `index_io`) and add a short module docstring noting why.
